				to stumble</i>, <i>a stumblingblock</i> (eccl.
			Lat.). * </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b>
			<b>Lit.</b>, <i><span class="en">Prud. Apoth. 47
